WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.606 --> 00:00:08.975
Help is at the bottom of the sidebar. It has the articles, the glossary, the blog, and a way to reach a person.

2
00:00:09.681 --> 00:00:17.655
Type in Search the help articles to find an answer. Here, budget finds the articles and glossary words that mention it.

3
00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:23.049
Open a result to read the article, with its sections listed on the right.

4
00:00:23.755 --> 00:00:29.444
The Glossary explains the words of Guildwise HQ, from allow-list to workstation.

5
00:00:30.143 --> 00:00:34.311
What’s new lists the latest changes, newest first.

6
00:00:36.262 --> 00:00:40.767
And the Blog tab has articles from the team on AI agents and automation.

7
00:00:41.479 --> 00:00:48.166
When the articles are not enough, Contact us sends a question, a problem or an idea to the Guildwise team.

8
00:00:48.866 --> 00:00:56.097
My requests keeps everything you sent, with the answers. A new reply is marked, so you do not miss it.

9
00:00:56.804 --> 00:01:02.133
On any page, the question mark in the top bar explains what is on the page behind it.

10
00:01:02.832 --> 00:01:07.639
And on the Help centre, you can take or replay the guided tour of the sidebar at any time.

11
00:01:08.338 --> 00:01:13.166
That is Help. Search first, and write to us when you need a person.
